{
  "_comment": [
    "MACHINE HUB - this is what a technician sees after scanning the QR sticker.",
    "",
    "Applied as a row formatter on the 'Machine Hub' view of Machine_Master. The view",
    "is reached with ?FilterField1=Machine_ID&FilterValue1=<id>&FilterType1=Text, so it",
    "renders exactly one card: the machine that was just scanned.",
    "",
    "Design constraints that are not negotiable:",
    "  * Every button is 48 px tall. These are pressed with gloved fingers, often with",
    "    one hand, standing next to a running machine. 44 px is the accessibility floor;",
    "    48 gives margin for a glove.",
    "  * The machine name is shown large at the top so the technician can confirm he",
    "    scanned the sticker he thinks he scanned. A wrong sticker discovered later is a",
    "    field problem that takes a month to find.",
    "  * Buttons are ordered by how often they are pressed, not by importance:",
    "    Start PM and Checklist are the daily path and sit first.",
    "  * The URLs come from the stored per-machine form links, so Machine_ID and Cell_ID",
    "    arrive at the form pre-filled. The technician types nothing the system knows."
  ],

  "ViewFormat": {
    "$schema": "https://developer.microsoft.com/json-schemas/sp/v2/row-formatting.schema.json",
    "hideSelection": true,
    "hideColumnHeader": true,
    "elmType": "div",
    "style": {
      "font-family": "'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif",
      "background-color": "#FFFFFF",
      "border": "1px solid #D9E2E6",
      "border-radius": "10px",
      "padding": "20px",
      "margin-bottom": "12px",
      "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px rgba(12,53,73,0.10)"
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "elmType": "div",
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flex-direction": "row", "align-items": "center", "margin-bottom": "4px" },
        "children": [
          {
            "elmType": "div",
            "txt": "=[$Machine_ID]",
            "style": {
              "font-size": "26px", "font-weight": "700", "color": "#0C3549", "letter-spacing": "0.5px"
            }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "div",
            "txt": "='  ·  Criticality ' + [$Criticality]",
            "style": {
              "font-size": "13px", "font-weight": "600", "margin-left": "10px",
              "padding": "3px 10px", "border-radius": "12px", "color": "#FFFFFF",
              "background-color": "=if([$Criticality] == 'A', '#ED7373', if([$Criticality] == 'B', '#F0A202', '#7B8794'))"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "elmType": "div",
        "txt": "=[$Machine_Name]",
        "style": { "font-size": "18px", "font-weight": "600", "color": "#1F2933", "margin-bottom": "2px" }
      },
      {
        "elmType": "div",
        "txt": "=[$Cell_ID] + ' · ' + [$Cell_Name] + '  |  ' + [$Location_Tag] + '  |  Checklist ' + [$Checklist_ID]",
        "style": { "font-size": "13px", "color": "#7B8794", "margin-bottom": "16px" }
      },

      {
        "elmType": "div",
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flex-direction": "column" },
        "children": [
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "▶   START PM  (scan in)",
            "attributes": { "href": "=[$Checklist_Form_URL]", "target": "_blank", "role": "button" },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px", "margin-bottom": "10px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700", "letter-spacing": "0.3px",
              "background-color": "#0C3549", "color": "#FFFFFF", "border": "none"
            }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "☑   COMPLETE CHECKLIST",
            "attributes": { "href": "=[$Checklist_Form_URL]", "target": "_blank", "role": "button" },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px", "margin-bottom": "10px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700",
              "background-color": "#2E86AB", "color": "#FFFFFF", "border": "none"
            }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "⚠   REPORT BREAKDOWN",
            "attributes": { "href": "=[$Breakdown_Form_URL]", "target": "_blank", "role": "button" },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px", "margin-bottom": "10px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700",
              "background-color": "#ED7373", "color": "#FFFFFF", "border": "none"
            }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "🔧   REQUEST SPARE",
            "attributes": { "href": "=[$Spare_Request_Form_URL]", "target": "_blank", "role": "button" },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px", "margin-bottom": "10px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700",
              "background-color": "#FFFFFF", "color": "#0C3549", "border": "2px solid #0C3549"
            }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "👁   LOG ABNORMALITY",
            "attributes": { "href": "=[$Abnormality_Form_URL]", "target": "_blank", "role": "button" },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700",
              "background-color": "#FFFFFF", "color": "#0C3549", "border": "2px solid #0C3549"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
